{"id":"103020-44-bccd","year":103,"exam":"103年第一次專門職業及技術人員高等考試牙醫師考試分階段考試、藥師、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、助產師、物理治療師、職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師考試","level":"專技高考","subject":"微生物學與臨床微生物學（包括細菌與黴菌）","code":"4311","type":"測驗題","fixed":false,"classes":["醫事檢驗師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=103020&c=311&s=44&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"細菌的Fimbriae之主要作用為何？","opts":["有性生殖","表面吸附","細菌運動性","抗生素抵抗性"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"下列那些結構只見於革蘭氏陰性菌？①Outer membrane ②Peptidoglycan layer ③Periplasm④Capsule","opts":["僅①②","僅①②③","僅①③","僅②③④"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"有關革蘭氏陽性菌細胞壁之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["peptidoglycan及teichoic acids為主要成分","N-acetylglucosamine及N-acetylmuramic acid以1：4連結為glycan chain","以dipeptides為橫向橋接","teichoic acids為固定細胞壁到細胞膜"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"革蘭氏陽性菌細胞壁中之（L-alanine）-（D-glutamine）-（L-lysine）-（D-alanine）胜肽功能為何？","opts":["形成聚醣鏈（glycan chain）","連結膜蛋白（membrane protein）","橫向橋接（cross-linkage）","固定細胞壁到細胞膜"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"下列何菌生長於綿羊血平板培養基時，其菌落特徵為β-溶血圈，須追加6.5% NaCl tolerance，Bile-esculin，CAMP test等生化試驗鑑定之？","opts":["Staphylococcus","Streptococcus","Pseudomonas","Proteus"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"最常見汙染炒飯，引起胃腸道感染之細菌為何？","opts":["Staphylococcus aureus","Bacillus cereus","Vibrio spp.","Enterococcus spp."],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"有關Columbia CNA（colistin-nalidixic acid）agar之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["選擇性培養基","鑑別性培養基","抑制革蘭氏陰性細菌","含有膽鹽"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"有關人類李斯特菌症（Listeriosis）之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["孕婦感染可引起類流感症狀","子宮內感染可能導致流產、死產或新生兒疾病","早發型新生兒李斯特菌症比晚發型具有更高的死亡率","低抵抗力宿主經食物媒介感染，引起毒素型食物中毒，主要症狀是嘔吐、腹瀉"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"有關Corynebacterium jeikeium特性之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["對常用藥物具多重抗藥性","在培養基中添加血清可促進其生長","可引起心內膜炎、敗血症、腦膜炎、肺炎等多種機緣性感染","生長快速，在BAP隔夜培養，可形成大型β-溶血菌落"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"下列何種細菌最常被視為噬肉菌（flesh-eating bacteria）？","opts":["Streptococcus agalactiae","Streptococcus pyogenes","Staphylococcus aureus","Staphylococcus lugdunensis"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":11,"q":"下列何者最不可能是腸球菌感染引起的疾病？","opts":["泌尿道感染","腦膜炎","菌血症及心內膜炎","結腸炎"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":12,"q":"要以單一劑量vancomycin篩檢抗萬古黴素腸球菌（VRE）時，下列何種作法錯誤？","opts":["使用含1 mg/mL vancomycin之Mueller-Hinton agar","接種原菌量為105-6 CFU/spot","35℃培養24小時後判讀","判讀時產生多於一個以上的菌落，即視為VRE"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":13,"q":"若一株β-溶血性鏈球菌，對0.04 unit bacitracin呈感受性，CAMP test陰性，PYR test陽性，則其最可能為下列何種菌？","opts":["Group A Streptococcus","Group B Streptococcus","Group C Streptococcus","Group D Streptococcus"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":14,"q":"Staphylococcus aureus之所以可用於製備coagglutination test reagent，是因其具備下列何種特殊構造？","opts":["protein A","bound coagulase","clumping factor","polysaccharide capsule"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":15,"q":"痰檢體之Kinyoun染色結果，在10個油鏡視野下觀察到1～9隻抗酸菌，其結果報告為何？","opts":["1＋","2＋","3＋","4＋"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":16,"q":"有關非結核桿菌群分枝桿菌，菌種與疾病配對之敘述，下列何者最不合適？","opts":["M. kansasii：侵襲肺部","M. marinum：泳池肉芽腫","M. avium complex：急性腹瀉","M. xenopi：嚴重糖尿病患者較易受感染"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":17,"q":"X、V因子需求試驗，主要用於下列何種細菌的鑑定？","opts":["Campylobacter","Haemophilus","Bordetella","Pasteurella"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":18,"q":"下列何種細菌的Phenylalanine deaminase試驗為陰性？","opts":["Klebsiella pneumoniae","Proteus vulgaris","Providencia stuartii","Morganella morganii"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":19,"q":"下列何種E. coli會引起旅行者腹瀉，出現不帶有血或黏液的水樣腹瀉？","opts":["EnterohemorrhagicE. coli（EHEC）","EnteropathogenicE. coli（EPEC）","EnterotoxigenicE. coli（ETEC）","Enteroinvasive","coli（EIEC）"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[],"broken":true},{"no":20,"q":"ONPG試驗以下列何者為受質？","opts":["5%α-naphthol＋40%KOH","p-dimethylaminobenzaldehyde","o-nitrophenyl galactoside","Sulfanilic acid＋α-naphthylamine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":21,"q":"下列何者為Proteus mirabilis與Proteus vulgaris的indole試驗結果？","opts":["P. mirabilis (＋)，P. vulgaris (＋)","P. mirabilis (＋)，P. vulgaris (－)","P. mirabilis (－)，P. vulgaris (＋)","P. mirabilis (－)，P. vulgaris (－)"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":22,"q":"下列何種細菌不具運動性？","opts":["Pseudomonas aeruginosa","Pseudomonas fluorescens","Burkholderia mallei","Burkholderia pseudomallei"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":23,"q":"有關Campylobacter spp.之培養基，下列何者不適用？","opts":["Buffered Charcoal Yeast Extract（BCYE）agar","Campy blood agar","Skirrow's blood agar","Charcoal cefoperazone deoxycholate agar（CCDA）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":24,"q":"下列何菌感染主要與腹瀉無關？","opts":["Enterococcus spp.","Vibrio spp.","Aeromonas spp.","Campylobacter spp."],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":25,"q":"實驗室診斷Bordetella感染，最好採集下列何種檢體進行培養？","opts":["Blood","Urine","Nasopharyngeal aspirate or swab","Throat swab"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":26,"q":"下列何種生化試驗可以區分Escherichia coli與Edwardsiella tarda？","opts":["urease試驗","H S試驗2","oxidase試驗","VP試驗"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":27,"q":"下列何者為Simmon's citrate agar所使用的pH指示劑？","opts":["Phenol red","Methyl red","Methylene blue","Bromothymol blue"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":28,"q":"下列何者不符合Klebsiella pneumoniae的鑑定特性？","opts":["VP (＋)","Urease (＋)","Citrate (＋)","Motility (＋)"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":29,"q":"感染Legionella pneumophila serogroup 1後，若不治療，病患尿液出現Legionella抗原的效價最長可持續多久？","opts":["1週","2週","1個月","2個月以上"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":30,"q":"最適合Legionella spp.生長的培養基之pH值為：","opts":["7.9","7.2","6.9","6.5"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":31,"q":"有關Pseudomonas spp.的glucose oxidation試驗，下列敘述何者正確？","opts":["P. aeruginosa (－)，P. fluorescens (－)","P. aeruginosa (＋)，P. fluorescens (－)","P. aeruginosa (＋)，P. fluorescens (＋)","P. aeruginosa (－)，P. fluorescens (＋)"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":32,"q":"有關Stenotrophomonas maltophilia的特性，下列敘述何者錯誤？","opts":["Lysine decarboxylase (＋)","DNase (＋)","Polymyxin B (Susceptible)","OF test (mannitol) (＋)"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":33,"q":"下列何種細菌為oxidase (＋)、運動性(＋)，且OF試驗為葡萄糖氧化(＋)？","opts":["Acinetobacter baumannii","Moraxella catarrhalis","Pseudomonas aeruginosa","Alcaligenes faecalis"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":34,"q":"有關Guillain-Barrésyndrome，下列敘述何者錯誤？","opts":["和Campylobacter jejuni有關","是一種自體免疫疾病","是一種神經疾病","腸胃症狀之嚴重性和此病發生率呈正相關"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":35,"q":"由AIDS病人糞便培養出某彎曲桿菌，nitrate還原反應陰性，最有可能為：","opts":["Campylobacter coli","Helicobacter fennelliae","Helicobacter cinaedi","Campylobacter jejuni"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列何者會造成Weil's disease？","opts":["Leptospira","Francisella","Brucella","Streptobacillus"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"有關Chlamydia spp.之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["不能產生ATP","elementary body代謝不活躍","Reticulate body存在宿主細胞內","不具有16S rRNA"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"某厭氧菌，indole陽性，不能分解醣類，會產生succinic acids，最可能為下列何者？","opts":["Prevotella melaninogenica","Porphyromonas gingivalis","Fusobacterium mortiferum","Bacteroides fragilis"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"「Darmbrand」，一種necrotizing bowel disease（NBD），主要由下列何種細菌引起？","opts":["Actinomyces israelii","Clostridium perfringens","Prevotella melaninogenica","Fusobacterium nucleatum"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":40,"q":"下列何種Clostridium spp.其Nagler試驗及reverse-CAMP試驗皆為陽性？","opts":["C. tetani","C. sordellii","C. perfringens","C. difficile"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":41,"q":"披衣菌中之TWAR strain是指下列何者？","opts":["Chlamydia trachomatis","Chlamydophila psittaci","Chlamydophila pneumoniae","Chlamydia pecorum"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":42,"q":"有關Chlamydia trachomatis及Chlamydophila pneumoniae之比較，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["只有C.trachomatis之inclusion body含glycogen","兩者DNA相似度90%","兩者天然宿主皆為humans","只有C. pneumoniae具梨形elementary body"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":43,"q":"下列何種菌會引起antibiotic-associated pseudomembranous colitis？","opts":["Fusobacterium nucleatum","Veillonella parvula","Prevotella intermedia","Clostridium difficile"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":44,"q":"下列何者為黴漿菌（mycoplasma）細胞壁的特徵？","opts":["沒有肽聚糖（peptidoglycan）","含有與革蘭氏陰性菌細胞壁相似的肽聚糖","含有與革蘭氏陽性菌細胞壁相似的肽聚糖","含有獨特的肽聚糖"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":45,"q":"下列何者不屬於抗黴菌藥物？","opts":["Amphotericin B","Nystatin","Imidazole","Polymyxin B"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":46,"q":"Trimethoprim可抑制下列何種酵素？","opts":["Dihydrofolate reductase","DNA polymerase","β-lactamase","DNA-dependent RNA polymerase"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":47,"q":"下列何者是最常引起院內感染之黴菌？","opts":["Candida glabrata","Aspergillus niger","Candida albicans","Candida krusei"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":48,"q":"下列關於ESBLs之敘述，那些正確？①是指Extended spectrumβ-lactamases ②可以使用cefotaxime、ceftazidime等抗生素來篩選ESBLs的菌株 ③測試越多種第三代頭孢素的抗生素，篩選ESBLs菌株的機率就越高 ④使用cefpodoxime較容易找到產生ESBLs的菌株","opts":["僅①②③","僅①②④","僅①③④","①②③④"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":49,"q":"下列選項中那兩項是臺灣醫院感染管制學會建議的例行環境檢查？①滅菌鍋的指示劑監控 ②冷卻水塔水質檢測 ③血液透析室水質檢測 ④飲水機的水質檢測","opts":["①②","①③","②④","③④"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":50,"q":"以紙錠擴散法測定細菌的藥物感受性時，若產生偽抗藥性，最不可能的因素為何？","opts":["培養基太厚","藥物失效","接種菌量太多","培養時間太短"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":51,"q":"關於淋病雙球菌（Neisseria gonorrhoeae）抗生素感受性試驗，下列敘述何者錯誤？","opts":["一般以GC agar為基底，滅菌後再加上1%之營養添加物（defined broth supplement）來作為試驗培養基","培養皿置於5%二氧化碳培養箱內","常以快速法測試β-lactamase之存在","常用試管稀釋法（broth macrodilution method）進行試驗"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"下列何者不是臨床上常用之結核桿菌藥敏試驗法？","opts":["紙錠擴散法（disk diffusion method）","絕對濃度法（absolute concentration method）","比例法（proportion method）","抗藥性比法（resistance ratio method）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"有關厭氧菌藥物感受性之敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["目前只有Bacteroides fragilis具β-lactamase","具臨床意義之厭氧菌皆需進行藥敏試驗","大多數厭氧菌對Imipenem具感受性","建議以Broth disk elution法進行藥敏試驗"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"自動化儀器利用生物冷光法（Bioluminescence）分析細菌的活性，係在偵測細菌產生的︰","opts":["CO2","H O2","ATP","pH change"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"下列何種試驗不能用來作檢測莢膜？","opts":["India ink染色","Quellung反應","莢膜染色","Periodic acid-Schiff染色"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"下列何種尿液檢體之培養，是以＞l05 CFU/mL的菌落數作為判讀陽性之標準？","opts":["服用抗生素之病患","膀胱穿刺","門診病患中段尿","住院病患導尿"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"適合做細菌培養的痰檢體，在100×鏡檢下應為下列何種情況？","opts":["WBC＞25，鱗狀上皮細胞＜10","WBC＜25，鱗狀上皮細胞＜10","WBC＞10，鱗狀上皮細胞＞25","WBC＜10，鱗狀上皮細胞＞25"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"下列何菌是經由性接觸（sexual transmission）而感染的非淋菌性尿道炎（Nongonococcalurethritis）之致病菌？","opts":["Haemophilus influenzae","Mycoplasma pneumoniae","Chlamydia trachomatis","Streptococcus pneumoniae"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"有關腦脊髓液檢體操作細菌培養之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["以收集之第二管作細菌培養為佳","可離心濃縮","立即培養","若不能立即培養，須先置於4℃冰箱"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"黴菌的菌絲（hypha），可深入培養基，負責吸收養分及水分，稱為：","opts":["Aerial hypha","Vegetative hypha","Reproductive hypha","Coenocytic hypha"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"俗稱園丁病，是指下列何種黴菌病？","opts":["真菌腫（Eumycetoma）","孢子絲菌症（Sporotrichosis）","產色黴菌病（Chromoblastomycosis）","暗色絲孢菌病（Phaeohyphomycosis）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"下列何種皮癬菌屬於親動物性（zoophilic）？","opts":["Microsporum gypseum","Trichophyton rubrum","Microsporum canis","Epidermophyton floccosum"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"下圖為全身性黴菌感染症致病菌的酵母菌型，壁厚且大（15～30μm），有多個且窄底的出芽生殖，看起來像船的方向舵（mariner's wheel），則此黴菌為：","opts":["粗球孢子菌（Coccidioides immitis）","巴西副球黴菌（Paracoccidioides brasiliensis）","莢膜組織漿菌（Histoplasma capsulatum）","皮炎芽生黴菌（Blastomyces dermatitidis）"],"fig":true,"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"伺機性黴菌病（Opportunistic Mycoses）最常發生在下列何種患者？","opts":["免疫功能不全者","高血壓患者","視障者","復健科病人"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"有關新型隱球菌（Cryptococcus neoformans）的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["由臨床檢體分離出，需考慮汙染的可能性","會侵犯腦中樞神經系統（CNS）造成腦膜炎（meningitis）","可用紅黴素（Erythromycin）或四環素（Tetracycline）治療","會引起頭癬髮內感染（endothrix）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":66,"q":"在Niger seed agar培養呈黑褐色菌落之黴菌為：","opts":["Aspergillus niger","Microsporum canis","Cryptococcus neoformans","Histoplasma capsulatum"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"下列那一個菌門在臨床上引起最多黴菌病？","opts":["不完全菌門（Deuteromycota）","接合菌門（Zygomycota）","子囊菌門（Ascomycota）","擔子菌門（Basidiomycota）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"如下圖，皮癬菌之顯微形態其大分生孢子壁厚且粗大呈紡錘狀多細胞，尖端微鉤，而小分生孢子不明顯，但亦可出現，最可能為下列何者？","opts":["Epidermophyton floccosum","Microsporum canis","Trichophyton rubrum","Trichophyton mentagrophytes"],"fig":true,"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"有關臨床上癬（Tinea）的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["指甲癬最多是Microsporum spp.引起的","頭癬最常見是Epidermophyton spp.","引起香港腳最常見的是Trichophyton spp.","引起指甲癬的黴菌，通常感染手指甲就不會感染腳指甲"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"通常用於黴菌病檢體組織切片染色的方法為：","opts":["Lactophenol cotton blue stain","Periodic acid-schiff stain","Liu's stain","India Ink stain"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"下列何種抗黴菌藥物的機制是抑制14-α去甲基酶來影響麥角醇（ergosterol）合成？","opts":["Amphotericin B","5-Fluorocytosine","Ketoconazole","Griseofulvin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"抗黴菌藥物Terbinafine屬於下列何者？","opts":["Polyene","Azole","Allylamine","Flucytosine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"觀察Candida albicans的顯微形態時，應接種於下列何種培養基？","opts":["Brain heart infusion agar","Sabouraud dextrose agar","Blood agar plate","Cornmeal Tween 80 agar"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"下列何種細菌與腫瘤形成有關？","opts":["Clostridium septicum","Clostridium perfringens","Bacteroides ureolyticus","Bacteroides fragilis"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"新生兒腦脊髓液的培養結果：BAP具部分溶血且有凹陷的菌落；革蘭氏陽性球菌；Optochinsusceptible。此菌最可能為：","opts":["Group B streptococci","Listeria monocytogenes","Corynebacterium spp.","Streptococcus pneumoniae"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"下列何者不是Aeromonas hydrophila的特徵？","opts":["String test陰性","oxidase陽性","Indole陰性","sheep blood agar上β-溶血"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"下列何種方法無法測得微生物抗生素的MIC值？","opts":["Broth dilution assay","E-test","Disc diffusion assay","Agar dilution assay"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"下列何種細菌尚無可使用之疫苗？","opts":["Neisseria gonorrhoeae","Haemophilus influenzae","Streptococcus pneumoniae","Neisseria meningitidis"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"被狗咬傷的傷口，發現較小的革蘭氏陰性桿菌，indole陽性，無運動性。此菌最有可能為何？","opts":["Escherichia coli","Pasteurella multocida","Brucella canis","Haemophilus influenzae"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"下列何種細菌易引發傷口感染，菌血症發燒及嘔吐等症狀？","opts":["Vibrio cholerae","Vibrio vulnificus","Vibrio parahaemolyticus","Vibrio mimicus"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}]}